<title>RUSSIA: Russian June unemployment slows to 9.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian June unemployment slows to 9.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Russia was 6.9 million, or 9.5 percent of the workforce, at the end of June, down from May's 9.6 percent, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 JUNE 97     MAY 97     JUNE 96</p>
<p>    number unemployed (mln)	6.90	6.97	 6.67</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce	9.5	  9.6	  N/A</p>
<p>    officially registered (mln)  2.32	 2.41	 2.61</p>
<p>NOTES - Figures for total unemployed are based on the methodology of the International Labour Organisation.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
